      "content": "the thing is i don't think it's just a phase or a bad mood. i actually feel like the only way to fix the shame is to just... not be here anymore. like, if i'm gone, the mistake is gone too. then they can just remember the person they thought i was, instead of seeing what i actually became. it feels like the only way to protect them from the embarrassment of me.",
